WEBVTT

00:21.580 --> 00:22.630
<b>A half-demon?</b>

00:22.630 --> 00:23.750
<b>Don't let your guards down!</b>

00:27.960 --> 00:28.790
<b>What?!</b>

00:28.790 --> 00:32.000
<b>We have 4 half-demons worth
of magical energy on us!</b>

00:32.330 --> 00:33.500
<b>You bastards!</b>

00:49.830 --> 00:51.330
<b>Is that you, Euphemia?</b>

00:52.580 --> 00:53.790
<b>Big Sister Theo...</b>

00:58.040 --> 01:02.880
<b>You will all kill each other until there's
only one of you left standing.</b>

01:03.170 --> 01:05.710
<b>This trial will commence
in one hour.</b>

01:05.920 --> 01:09.670
<b>One hour after the start, those who
have not killed anyone will be killed.</b>

01:09.670 --> 01:12.500
<b>Alpha Omega</b>

01:09.670 --> 01:12.500
<b>Second Door</b>

01:09.670 --> 01:12.500
<b>Open</b>

01:09.960 --> 01:12.500
<b>You will also be killed
if you leave the castle walls.</b>

01:13.080 --> 01:16.210
<b>The remaining survivor will be
the winner of the trial.</b>

01:16.540 --> 01:18.000
<b>We have to kill each other?!</b>

01:18.000 --> 01:19.040
<b>This is absurd!</b>

01:19.040 --> 01:22.750
<b>(Death God)</b>

01:19.040 --> 01:22.750
<b>Causes Instant Death to target.</b>

01:19.880 --> 01:22.750
<b>In that case, you should die.</b>

01:23.040 --> 01:24.960
<b>That's fine by me.</b>

01:24.960 --> 01:29.330
<b>If you actually succeed in killing me,
the trial shall end.</b>

01:30.080 --> 01:34.460
<b>Are you trying to imply that our Gifts
won't work on you or something?</b>

01:34.750 --> 01:36.920
<b>I wouldn't say that, but...</b>

01:36.920 --> 01:39.000
<b>You have a much better
chance at surviving</b>

01:39.000 --> 01:40.920
<b>if you just go ahead with
the battle royale.</b>

01:41.210 --> 01:42.330
<b>Die.</b>

01:44.670 --> 01:46.460
<b>It doesn't work on you!</b>

01:46.460 --> 01:48.250
<b>It does, though!</b>

01:48.250 --> 01:52.830
<b>I died just a moment ago, but all I have
to do is come back to life, you know?</b>

01:53.420 --> 01:55.380
<b>Die. Die. Die. Die...</b>

01:55.380 --> 02:00.670
<b>I keep leveling up in one-second intervals,
so I completely recover each time.</b>

02:00.670 --> 02:03.250
<b>And when I die, I will come back to life.</b>

02:03.250 --> 02:05.710
<b>Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!</b>

02:08.580 --> 02:11.710
<b>All right, then. You've got no time
to dilly-dally, everyone!</b>

02:15.630 --> 02:18.380
<b>Where could Takatou-kun have gone?</b>

02:19.920 --> 02:21.130
<b>Tomochi!</b>

02:21.330 --> 02:23.290
<b>(Counter)</b>

02:21.330 --> 02:23.290
<b>(Archivist)</b>

02:21.340 --> 02:22.750
<b>We're in big trouble!</b>

02:23.460 --> 02:24.750
<b>What's wrong?</b>

02:27.920 --> 02:32.790
<b>A novel I read a long time ago
involved a being that surpassed humans,</b>

02:32.790 --> 02:36.000
<b>and the word "ethos" appears in the story.</b>

02:36.290 --> 02:38.630
<b>I think it was translated as "character."</b>

02:38.960 --> 02:44.960
<b>It is said that what a superior being needs
is not ethics or morals but character.</b>

02:46.210 --> 02:47.790
<b>I don't really get it.</b>

02:47.790 --> 02:49.210
<b>The point is,</b>

02:49.210 --> 02:53.630
<b>it's impossible to apply ethics and morals
to beings that surpass humans.</b>

02:53.630 --> 02:57.130
<b>Instead, they have to make
their own rules for themselves.</b>

02:57.130 --> 03:00.210
<b>You mean I should come up
with my own rules?</b>

03:00.670 --> 03:01.960
<b>That's right.</b>

03:01.960 --> 03:04.920
<b>Just because you can do anything
doesn't mean you should go wild.</b>

03:05.330 --> 03:07.000
<b>I'm telling you to think it over carefully,</b>

03:07.000 --> 03:11.460
<b>and then determine what kind of
character you should adhere to.</b>

03:12.000 --> 03:16.540
<b>But if I follow the rules that I made,
then all I can do is die right now.</b>

03:16.880 --> 03:20.000
<b>But I promised I would send
Dannoura-san back to our world...</b>

03:23.540 --> 03:25.380
<b>I'll kill my momentum.</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:41.630
<b>So, this is the 7th layer...</b>

03:51.000 --> 03:53.290
<b>Has something changed?</b>

03:53.290 --> 03:55.670
<b>The fact that the seal is gone</b>

03:55.670 --> 04:00.250
<b>is proof that my brother has
given me his approval to leave.</b>

04:00.250 --> 04:03.460
<b>May we go ahead and leave now?</b>

04:00.250 --> 04:03.460
<b>(Healer)</b>

04:03.710 --> 04:04.920
<b>Hm, let me think.</b>

04:04.920 --> 04:10.540
<b>Constantly looking at your hideous face
will eventually get on my nerves,</b>

04:10.540 --> 04:13.290
<b>so you should leave
before I change my mind.</b>

04:13.290 --> 04:14.500
<b>Okay.</b>

04:15.540 --> 04:17.580
<b>Lord Lute, let's go.</b>

04:17.580 --> 04:18.710
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:21.540 --> 04:24.080
<b>Hm? It seems I'm having trouble walking...</b>

04:24.080 --> 04:26.920
<b>Yikes! What is this?!</b>

04:27.750 --> 04:30.500
<b>Mana-sama's body is expanding.</b>

04:30.500 --> 04:31.380
<b>What?!</b>

04:31.540 --> 04:34.080
<b>She's started preparations
for birthing the Master.</b>

04:34.080 --> 04:35.830
<b>And we're in the middle of it?</b>

04:35.830 --> 04:37.250
<b>Yes, we're inside of Mana-sama.</b>

04:38.710 --> 04:41.000
<b>She's going to absorb us! Run!</b>

04:41.000 --> 04:42.420
<b>Where do we run to?!</b>

04:42.420 --> 04:44.210
<b>You got full authority
in the Underworld, right?</b>

04:44.210 --> 04:46.290
<b>You should know a shortcut then.</b>

04:46.290 --> 04:47.580
<b>Then let's go together!</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:51.330
<b>Goodbye.</b>

04:57.630 --> 04:58.540
<b>Lord Lute!</b>

06:39.290 --> 06:42.500
<b>So, you're saying that you've become
an Origin Blood, yes?</b>

06:42.500 --> 06:43.330
<b>Yes.</b>

06:43.330 --> 06:47.580
<b>Because Euphemia-san can sense
her people's presence,</b>

06:47.580 --> 06:50.790
<b>we decided to continue on while searching.</b>

06:51.290 --> 06:53.000
<b>May I accompany you?</b>

06:53.000 --> 06:54.960
<b>You are more than welcome to!</b>

06:55.500 --> 06:58.040
<b>By the way, what are you going to
the royal capitol for?</b>

06:58.040 --> 07:00.250
<b>I'm going to go meet Yogiri-san!</b>

07:00.250 --> 07:03.420
<b>I mean, he might be there,
I don't really know.</b>

07:03.750 --> 07:05.130
<b>That won't be a problem.</b>

07:05.130 --> 07:07.750
<b>Lord Takatou also said
he'd be heading to the capitol.</b>

07:07.750 --> 07:10.000
<b>You've met him before?!</b>

07:11.000 --> 07:12.830
<b>Do you think it'll be okay over there?</b>

07:12.830 --> 07:15.790
<b>Things'll be rough if
the killing has already started.</b>

07:15.790 --> 07:17.830
<b>If it gets dangerous let me know.</b>

07:17.830 --> 07:19.330
<b>I'll try to help out.</b>

07:19.330 --> 07:20.380
<b>Thank you!</b>

07:25.040 --> 07:28.040
<b>Why are you attacking me?!</b>

07:30.710 --> 07:33.330
<b>My utmost apologies!</b>

07:33.920 --> 07:35.630
<b>Why are you here?</b>

07:35.630 --> 07:38.040
<b>I would like to ask you the same thing!</b>

07:38.670 --> 07:41.670
<b>Now that I think of it, I said that
I'd kill you the next time we meet...</b>

07:41.670 --> 07:43.040
<b>You said no such thing!</b>

07:43.040 --> 07:44.670
<b>But forget that, take care of this!</b>

07:47.250 --> 07:48.080
<b>Die.</b>

07:51.960 --> 07:54.750
<b>I see your recklessness hasn't changed!</b>

07:54.750 --> 07:56.580
<b>I want to get back to the 6th layer.</b>

07:56.580 --> 07:57.920
<b>Any idea how to?</b>

07:58.330 --> 08:00.670
<b>Can't you go back the way you came?</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:03.000
<b>I crash landed here,
so I can't go back the same way.</b>

08:03.000 --> 08:04.920
<b>How are you still alive?!</b>

08:04.920 --> 08:06.750
<b>I killed the momentum sending me down.</b>

08:06.750 --> 08:08.580
<b>There's really no limit to
what you can do, is there?!</b>

08:08.580 --> 08:12.540
<b>If you want to go up, then you
should use a shortcut point.</b>

08:12.830 --> 08:14.130
<b>Okay, take me to one.</b>

08:14.130 --> 08:19.210
<b>There are multitudes of those jelly things
you saw earlier on the 7th layer.</b>

08:19.210 --> 08:21.830
<b>If you will protect me from them...</b>

08:21.830 --> 08:22.670
<b>Fine.</b>

08:22.670 --> 08:24.210
<b>Hm? Okay then.</b>

08:24.210 --> 08:25.210
<b>Wait a second.</b>

08:25.880 --> 08:27.420
<b>Bring this guy, too.</b>

08:27.420 --> 08:30.250
<b>Uh, and how am I to do that?</b>

08:30.250 --> 08:31.630
<b>Carry him piggyback.</b>

08:31.830 --> 08:34.210
<b>Why the hell do I have to carry a man?!</b>

08:34.210 --> 08:35.580
<b>Sora Akino's skill "Vow"</b>

08:34.210 --> 08:35.580
<b>has been disabled.</b>

08:35.750 --> 08:37.210
<b>Sage Candidate Selection</b>

08:35.750 --> 08:37.210
<b>Battle Participant List</b>

08:45.920 --> 08:51.080
<b>"Kiyoko Takekura, a girl with braided hair
wearing glasses, entered the room."</b>

08:51.080 --> 08:55.710
<b>(Gunslinger)</b>

08:51.080 --> 08:55.710
<b>Summons small arms and weapons at will.</b>

08:51.500 --> 08:53.420
<b>Her class is Gunslinger.</b>

08:53.420 --> 08:56.130
<b>As the name implies, she fights with a gun.</b>

08:56.750 --> 09:00.540
<b>"She trained her gun on the ceiling
and pulled the trigger,</b>

08:56.750 --> 09:00.170
<b>(Reader)</b>

08:56.750 --> 09:00.170
<b>Can understand the script</b>

08:56.750 --> 09:00.170
<b>of any language.</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.290
<b>and I became riddled with holes."</b>

09:02.500 --> 09:03.750
<b>What the hell?!</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:04.420
<b>...became riddled with.</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:08.420
<b>"Simultaneously, another person
entered from the opposite door."</b>

09:05.000 --> 09:07.460
<b>Simultaneously, another person...</b>

09:10.170 --> 09:11.580
<b>Ayaka Shinozaki!</b>

09:12.580 --> 09:15.750
<b>I'm surprised you suggested splitting up!</b>

09:15.750 --> 09:18.080
<b>It's risky for us to move as a group.</b>

09:18.080 --> 09:21.420
<b>That isn't criticism,
I'm actually praising you!</b>

09:22.210 --> 09:24.920
<b>It'd be different if I were with
Takatou-kun, though...</b>

09:25.250 --> 09:28.330
<b>About that boy, it seems
he's fallen to the 7th layer.</b>

09:28.330 --> 09:29.500
<b>Is he okay?</b>

09:29.500 --> 09:31.580
<b>He apparently doesn't know how
to get back here.</b>

09:31.580 --> 09:33.500
<b>I told him where we are.</b>

09:33.830 --> 09:38.960
<b>A system wasn't installed in me,
so hiding here should be fine, right?</b>

09:40.290 --> 09:41.790
<b>It's started.</b>

09:42.460 --> 09:44.420
<b>They started fighting just like that?!</b>

09:44.420 --> 09:47.460
<b>Their thoughts are being
guided by the systems,</b>

09:47.460 --> 09:49.540
<b>and it's making them belligerent!</b>

09:49.540 --> 09:50.540
<b>Wow...</b>

09:50.960 --> 09:53.580
<b>I suppose they'll fight until
there's only one left.</b>

09:59.580 --> 10:01.960
<b>You wanted to go to the 6th layer, right?</b>

10:01.960 --> 10:05.000
<b>Once I let you guys off at the 6th layer,
I'll head to the 1st layer.</b>

10:05.000 --> 10:08.040
<b>I can't operate this without you, can I?</b>

10:08.040 --> 10:10.130
<b>You have to come with me.</b>

10:10.330 --> 10:12.170
<b>That figures!</b>

10:12.630 --> 10:14.460
<b>"I arrived at a small room</b>

10:14.460 --> 10:18.170
<b>with a door made of metal and
a handwheel attached to it."</b>

10:18.500 --> 10:21.580
<b>"I tried to open the door,
but it wouldn't budge."</b>

10:22.670 --> 10:25.750
<b>"The moment I turned to leave,
the door began to open.</b>

10:26.210 --> 10:29.080
<b>Out came Yogiri Takatou and
Daimon Hanakawa,</b>

10:29.080 --> 10:31.710
<b>carrying David on his back."</b>

10:32.540 --> 10:34.750
<b>This is my chance to
kill them both at once!</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:41.250
<b>"Suddenly, the ceiling collapsed, and
the three of them were crushed and died."</b>

10:41.460 --> 10:42.710
<b>"I died."</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:44.290
<b>Why's it saying that?</b>

10:45.000 --> 10:46.670
<b>"I was eliminated."</b>

10:46.670 --> 10:48.330
<b>"I ceased to exist."</b>

10:48.330 --> 10:50.500
<b>"My biological functions stopped."</b>

10:50.790 --> 10:52.000
<b>"I've made a huge mistake."</b>

10:52.000 --> 10:53.000
<b>What the hell!</b>

10:53.000 --> 10:56.750
<b>My ability to know and change the future
should be the strongest!</b>

10:56.750 --> 10:59.210
<b>"I died. I died. I died. I died. I died."</b>

10:59.210 --> 11:00.290
<b>Damn it!</b>

11:03.130 --> 11:04.750
<b>"That was it for me."</b>

11:07.670 --> 11:08.580
<b>Die.</b>

11:10.670 --> 11:12.710
<b>Really?! Just like that?!</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:14.880
<b>He is your classmate!</b>

11:14.880 --> 11:17.380
<b>I only killed him because
I felt his intent to kill.</b>

11:20.500 --> 11:21.710
<b>There's no answer.</b>

11:21.710 --> 11:24.500
<b>How are you so casually
using your smartphone?!</b>

11:24.500 --> 11:27.830
<b>Uh, a system message just popped up!</b>

11:28.130 --> 11:29.250
<b>What's it say?</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:33.460
<b>Daimon Hanakawa's participation in the</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:33.460
<b>Sage Candidate Selection Battle</b>

11:29.250 --> 11:33.460
<b>has been approved.</b>

11:29.670 --> 11:33.460
<b>It's something about how I'm participating
in the Sage candidate selection battle!</b>

11:33.920 --> 11:35.290
<b>Perfect.</b>

11:35.290 --> 11:37.830
<b>This means if you try to run away
from the selection battle,</b>

11:37.830 --> 11:39.830
<b>Sion will come and kill you.</b>

11:39.830 --> 11:42.880
<b>Don't you think that's super messed up?!</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:55.580
<b>(Saint)</b>

11:53.000 --> 11:55.580
<b>Annihilates magical creatures with holy power.</b>

11:57.040 --> 11:58.000
<b>Mei-nyan.</b>

11:58.000 --> 12:00.670
<b>We should forget about the Sage thing
and go meowt on a trip!</b>

12:00.670 --> 12:03.250
<b>I gotta do an event when it comes around.</b>

12:03.250 --> 12:04.830
<b>I'm fed up with you.</b>

12:05.290 --> 12:08.710
<b>To think you're carelessly lazing around
within my domain.</b>

12:09.040 --> 12:10.290
<b>Arima-kun?</b>

12:10.750 --> 12:13.420
<b>Why didn't you just kill me?</b>

12:13.420 --> 12:15.210
<b>I'd feel guilty doing that.</b>

12:15.210 --> 12:18.040
<b>But I'm also ready to do
what needs to be done.</b>

12:22.380 --> 12:25.330
<b>(Carpenter)</b>

12:22.380 --> 12:25.330
<b>Can make and manage structures.</b>

12:27.170 --> 12:28.000
<b>Wha-?!</b>

12:28.580 --> 12:29.750
<b>How did you...?!</b>

12:30.000 --> 12:31.380
<b>I teleported.</b>

12:31.380 --> 12:33.830
<b>Wait, you're here too, Abukawa-kun?</b>

12:33.830 --> 12:37.790
<b>(Transporter)</b>

12:33.830 --> 12:37.790
<b>Can teleport things between doors at will.</b>

12:34.420 --> 12:37.790
<b>A Saint's power can do more than
just eradicate demonic creatures?!</b>

12:38.330 --> 12:40.250
<b>Sorry. I was fibbing.</b>

12:40.830 --> 12:41.920
<b>Eat this!</b>

12:48.080 --> 12:49.960
<b>Why are you perfectly fine?!</b>

12:49.960 --> 12:53.130
<b>I am immune to any and all attacks.</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:57.920
<b>Oh, yes. That's what I wanted to see.</b>

12:58.080 --> 13:01.920
<b>Faces twisted in utter despair
when people full of themselves</b>

13:01.920 --> 13:05.750
<b>are confronted with powers
greater than their own.</b>

13:06.210 --> 13:07.920
<b>It's my turn now.</b>

13:08.210 --> 13:11.670
<b>Saint's Bullseye K.O. Punch!</b>

13:18.460 --> 13:20.040
<b>What the heck kinda power is that...</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:23.210
<b>Heh heh, well...</b>

13:23.830 --> 13:27.250
<b>It was a few days before
our school field trip...</b>

13:33.290 --> 13:33.960
<b>What?</b>

13:38.000 --> 13:42.000
<b>I was killed by the beam of light
let loose from the cat's eyes, but...</b>

13:42.750 --> 13:45.710
<b>They immediately revived me,
and in apology,</b>

13:45.710 --> 13:49.670
<b>I was given powers through
a link with the cat god!</b>

13:51.380 --> 13:52.670
<b>Hooray!</b>

13:53.170 --> 13:56.290
<b>Then you could win against the Sage!</b>

13:56.290 --> 13:58.750
<b>We wouldn't have to kill each other!</b>

13:58.750 --> 14:00.960
<b>You know, that may be true.</b>

14:00.960 --> 14:05.710
<b>But if I'd killed the Sage, who would've
come up with this fun event for us?</b>

14:06.290 --> 14:07.540
<b>Well, I...</b>

14:07.540 --> 14:08.790
<b>And that's why...</b>

14:08.790 --> 14:10.630
<b>Saint Beam!</b>

14:14.830 --> 14:16.670
<b>Daimon Hanakawa's participation in the</b>

14:14.830 --> 14:16.670
<b>Sage Candidate Selection Battle</b>

14:14.840 --> 14:16.670
<b>has been approved.</b>

14:15.290 --> 14:16.670
<b>Hanakawa?!</b>

14:17.130 --> 14:19.540
<b>I guess I'll go kill him since he's here.</b>

14:23.750 --> 14:26.290
<b>Whoa! Is that you, Mei-tan?!</b>

14:26.540 --> 14:28.460
<b>And you're dressed as a Saint, eh?</b>

14:28.460 --> 14:30.500
<b>My goodness, I can just imagine
all the holy, saintly things</b>

14:30.500 --> 14:32.130
<b>you've got underneath that robe...</b>

14:32.130 --> 14:33.210
<b>Gross!</b>

14:34.750 --> 14:36.210
<b>Who're you again?</b>

14:36.210 --> 14:37.330
<b>Did you come to attack us?</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:40.670
<b>Saint Punch!</b>

14:43.790 --> 14:45.710
<b>What... was that?!</b>

14:46.080 --> 14:47.710
<b>The Dannoura Elbow.</b>

14:47.710 --> 14:49.460
<b>I learned the art of self-defense.</b>

14:50.790 --> 14:51.790
<b>How..?</b>

14:51.790 --> 14:53.830
<b>You won't kill her?</b>

14:53.830 --> 14:56.670
<b>We haven't been attacked in
any way that can kill us.</b>

14:57.540 --> 14:59.130
<b>What is going on?!</b>

14:59.130 --> 15:01.460
<b>Ridiculous! What in the world...</b>

15:01.460 --> 15:02.880
<b>Do something about this!</b>

15:03.380 --> 15:04.830
<b>I'm on it.</b>

15:05.330 --> 15:07.170
<b>I'm not gonna hold back on you anymore!</b>

15:07.170 --> 15:09.790
<b>Get out of my sight, all of you!</b>

15:10.580 --> 15:11.500
<b>Huh?</b>

15:11.500 --> 15:13.630
<b>People like you are easy to deal with</b>

15:13.630 --> 15:16.210
<b>because you're separated from
your power source.</b>

15:17.540 --> 15:19.130
<b>What did you do?</b>

15:19.130 --> 15:20.460
<b>I get it.</b>

15:20.460 --> 15:25.460
<b>The source of her power was killed,
so Mei-tan became powerless, correct?</b>

15:28.210 --> 15:29.630
<b>Mei-tan!</b>

15:29.630 --> 15:30.830
<b>This makes no sense!
</b><b>Mei-tan!</b><b></b>

15:30.830 --> 15:33.290
<b>Idiot! Moron! You're so gross!
</b><b>Oh no, Mei-tan!</b><b></b>

15:33.290 --> 15:33.790
<b>Idiot! Moron! You're so gross!</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:35.040
<b>Mei-tan!</b>

15:35.630 --> 15:38.330
<b>She probably ran away
because you're creepy.</b>

15:38.330 --> 15:40.080
<b>You're blaming me for that?!</b>

15:42.670 --> 15:45.380
<b>You jumping all over is so annoying!</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:52.420
<b>Where did that even come from?!</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:52.420
<b>(Android)</b>

15:49.960 --> 15:52.420
<b>Consumed a dragon and gained its powers.</b>

15:52.420 --> 15:55.630
<b>It looks like she can summon
small arms at will somehow.</b>

15:58.380 --> 16:01.040
<b>It's a bit rough just
sitting tight here, huh.</b>

16:01.290 --> 16:05.420
<b>Hm? There's someone here making use
of the spirits and setting them loose.</b>

16:05.420 --> 16:06.790
<b>Isn't that bad?</b>

16:07.130 --> 16:10.040
<b>In addition, there's some
electromagnetic disturbance happening.</b>

16:10.040 --> 16:12.380
<b>We won't be able to contact
the boy in this situation.</b>

16:12.380 --> 16:15.210
<b>How do ghosts cause
an electromagnetic disturbance?
</b><b>Hello? Anyone home?</b><b></b>

16:15.540 --> 16:18.250
<b>If we have been found,
staying still is a bad idea!</b>

16:24.420 --> 16:25.830
<b>Hey!</b>

16:26.500 --> 16:28.250
<b>Tomochi!</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:30.540
<b>Mikochi!</b>

16:30.540 --> 16:32.290
<b>She may be the sorcerer.</b>

16:32.290 --> 16:33.170
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:37.250
<b>Mikochi, your ability is just
counting things, right?</b>

16:37.250 --> 16:39.420
<b>I'm actually a Necromancer!</b>

16:39.420 --> 16:41.080
<b>Sorry I hid that from you.</b>

16:41.830 --> 16:44.290
<b>But... Where's Jiyuna?</b>

16:44.630 --> 16:46.460
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

16:46.460 --> 16:48.750
<b>She just disappeared somewhere.</b>

16:49.420 --> 16:50.710
<b>What did you come here for?</b>

16:51.290 --> 16:54.170
<b>I have a guiding spirit too.</b>

16:54.170 --> 16:55.080
<b>Huh?</b>

16:55.790 --> 16:58.080
<b>She said she's the princess
of an ancient species.</b>

16:58.630 --> 17:00.710
<b>Her name is Tiannu.</b>

17:00.710 --> 17:03.790
<b>The heck is that?! I want her too!</b>

17:03.790 --> 17:04.630
<b>Hey!</b>

17:04.630 --> 17:07.460
<b>I've got this spirit with
the dumb name of Mokomoko!</b>

17:07.460 --> 17:08.750
<b>Why are they so different?!</b>

17:09.000 --> 17:13.000
<b>The Dannoura's are a powerful family,
and I was a princess!</b>

17:13.000 --> 17:15.460
<b>And, what's wrong with
the name "Mokomoko"?!</b>

17:15.920 --> 17:17.290
<b>I've lost.</b>

17:17.290 --> 17:19.420
<b>Before we even start fighting, I've lost.</b>

17:20.290 --> 17:22.130
<b>Look, she's even shining!</b>

17:22.130 --> 17:24.290
<b>If this is coming to blows,
I shall wreck her!</b>

17:24.290 --> 17:25.630
<b>Come on, then! Bring it on!</b>

17:25.630 --> 17:27.080
<b>Only a real loser would resort to violence</b>

17:27.080 --> 17:29.000
<b>after losing to someone
in the looks department.</b>

17:29.000 --> 17:31.080
<b>What do you mean by a real loser?</b>

17:31.080 --> 17:35.290
<b>Tiannu is adorable,
but she can't do anything but count.</b>

17:35.290 --> 17:37.790
<b>So, can I have that one, please?</b>

17:37.790 --> 17:38.630
<b>What?</b>

17:38.630 --> 17:39.460
<b>Eh?!</b>

17:39.460 --> 17:40.380
<b>Huh?</b>

17:42.080 --> 17:43.920
<b>Oh, my apologies!</b>

17:43.920 --> 17:46.250
<b>This little lady is making me possess her.</b>

17:46.500 --> 17:48.170
<b>What is going on?!</b>

17:55.750 --> 17:57.250
<b>How are you that strong?</b>

17:57.880 --> 18:00.000
<b>What are you so confused about?</b>

18:00.000 --> 18:02.920
<b>You should be able to handle
this level of combat.</b>

18:03.250 --> 18:05.710
<b>You look like you're totally into
attacking me, though!</b>

18:05.920 --> 18:08.710
<b>Well, I'd really prefer not to do this,</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:11.920
<b>but she's using my power as she pleases!</b>

18:11.920 --> 18:13.630
<b>Weakest argument ever!</b>

18:13.630 --> 18:18.880
<b>Oh, and also, forgive me for this,
but I'm in control of that battle suit.</b>

18:19.420 --> 18:20.330
<b>Purge!</b>

18:23.790 --> 18:24.670
<b>Huh?</b>

18:26.580 --> 18:28.170
<b>Shut your eyes.</b>

18:28.170 --> 18:29.790
<b>If you disobey, I'll kill your eyes.</b>

18:29.790 --> 18:32.080
<b>My eyes! My eyes!</b>

18:38.710 --> 18:41.630
<b>I'm gonna get you for this, you asshole!</b>

18:41.630 --> 18:43.250
<b>Mokomoko-san, good job.</b>

18:43.670 --> 18:45.130
<b>Takatou-kun?!</b>

18:45.130 --> 18:48.380
<b>You have awful timing!
I mean, you did help me, though!</b>

18:48.380 --> 18:51.080
<b>But what the heck do you mean
by "good job"?!</b>

18:51.580 --> 18:53.790
<b>Huh? That was Mokomoko-san wasn't it?</b>

18:53.790 --> 18:55.250
<b>Glad you figured that out.</b>

18:55.250 --> 18:56.790
<b>I could tell by how she spoke.</b>

18:56.790 --> 18:59.420
<b>If she's attacking,
I have no choice but to kill her.</b>

19:00.170 --> 19:02.210
<b>Impressive, Yazaki-kun.</b>

19:02.210 --> 19:04.960
<b>You've established
an amazing group so far.</b>

19:05.710 --> 19:09.130
<b>The longer we survive,
the stronger we can become.</b>

19:09.130 --> 19:11.290
<b>Then we can challenge the Sage.</b>

19:11.290 --> 19:12.960
<b>That is what we've decided.</b>

19:12.960 --> 19:16.420
<b>(Idol)</b>

19:13.330 --> 19:16.460
<b>So, you targeting me is because</b>

19:16.460 --> 19:20.420
<b>you're upset that your position
as leader was taken away?</b>

19:20.420 --> 19:22.880
<b>If you work with me, I won't kill you.</b>

19:23.170 --> 19:25.210
<b>I'm going to decline, of course.</b>

19:25.670 --> 19:26.880
<b>Is that so?</b>

19:27.710 --> 19:29.540
<b>Surround the enemy and attack!</b>

19:32.500 --> 19:33.290
<b>Sora-chan! Sora-chan! Yeeaaah!</b>

19:33.290 --> 19:35.630
<b>What's an idol without her fans, hm?
</b><b>Sora-chan! Sora-chan! Yeeaaah!</b><b></b>

19:35.630 --> 19:36.080
<b>Sora-chan! Sora-chan! Yeeaaah!</b>

19:36.420 --> 19:38.040
<b>Kill them, one and all!</b>

19:39.500 --> 19:40.750
<b>Sora-chan!</b>

19:43.330 --> 19:45.380
<b>You made your allies blow themselves up?!</b>

19:45.630 --> 19:51.460
<b>Die-hard fans would do
anything they can to protect me.</b>

19:51.710 --> 19:53.040
<b>This is bad.</b>

19:53.040 --> 19:55.170
<b>Way trickier than I thought it'd be.</b>

19:55.170 --> 19:56.130
<b>Stop this!</b>

19:56.130 --> 19:57.830
<b>Damn it! Let go!</b>

20:00.750 --> 20:01.580
<b>Huh?</b>

20:01.580 --> 20:02.750
<b>What is that?</b>

20:02.750 --> 20:03.960
<b>Eh? No, no! No!</b>

20:03.960 --> 20:05.040
<b>Sora-chan!
</b><b>Eh? No, no! No!</b><b></b>

20:05.040 --> 20:06.250
<b>Eh? No, no! No!</b>

20:06.250 --> 20:07.080
<b>What?</b>

20:07.080 --> 20:08.080
<b>No!</b>

20:08.080 --> 20:10.040
<b>Help me, Haruto-kun!</b>

20:10.040 --> 20:10.920
<b>Yui!</b>

20:11.420 --> 20:12.920
<b>Help!</b>

20:15.170 --> 20:18.540
<b>I have no choice but to use
my secret weapon now.</b>

20:18.540 --> 20:19.630
<b>Haruto-kun?!</b>

20:19.630 --> 20:22.790
<b>Sorry, I can't afford to help you.</b>

20:27.630 --> 20:30.000
<b>But this is very bad.</b>

20:34.130 --> 20:37.420
<b>Is this the fear of
Tomochi's guardian spirit?!</b>

20:37.420 --> 20:39.290
<b>Do you want power?</b>

20:39.290 --> 20:40.250
<b>Eh?!</b>

20:41.920 --> 20:47.330
<b>The true power of a Necromancer
is much more than this!</b>

20:47.630 --> 20:51.000
<b>Could this be the awakening
that the Sage was talking about?!</b>

20:51.000 --> 20:55.130
<b>Now, relinquish the source of fear.</b>

20:55.130 --> 20:56.130
<b>Release!</b>

20:58.130 --> 21:01.710
<b>This is amazing! It's like the power
is running through my body!</b>

21:05.580 --> 21:07.790
<b>So, what's going on?</b>

21:07.790 --> 21:09.540
<b>Somehow her power has awakened!</b>

21:09.540 --> 21:10.580
<b>What?!
</b><b>Oh dear! Oh no!</b><b></b>

21:10.580 --> 21:13.210
<b>Hey, Tomochi, can you tell?</b>

21:13.210 --> 21:15.540
<b>I feel really great right now.</b>

21:15.790 --> 21:20.290
<b>It feels like the entire world
is throwing themselves at my feet.</b>

21:20.580 --> 21:22.670
<b>See, this is what I mean.</b>

21:23.580 --> 21:24.500
<b>Die.</b>

21:30.000 --> 21:31.790
<b>Er, um...</b>

21:31.790 --> 21:34.580
<b>I never saw this situation happening...</b>

21:34.580 --> 21:36.920
<b>Whatever, just gimme my clothes back.</b>

21:36.920 --> 21:38.080
<b>Oh, sure!</b>

21:39.880 --> 21:41.380
<b>Mikochi...</b>

21:44.710 --> 21:47.000
<b>Ya gotta do whatcha gotta do.
Let's change gears and keep it moving.</b>

21:47.290 --> 21:50.540
<b>Tomochika-tan! That's not how
a real heroine would act!</b>

21:50.540 --> 21:51.380
<b>Huh?</b>

21:51.380 --> 21:53.040
<b>Why are you here?</b>

21:53.040 --> 21:56.460
<b>"Takatou-kun, this is awful!
Beyond cruel!"</b>

21:56.460 --> 21:59.630
<b>Is what you say, then I'll be able
to take advantage of you...</b>

21:59.630 --> 22:03.380
<b>No matter what happens,
I'd never let you get that close to me.</b>

22:03.380 --> 22:04.330
<b>Oof!</b>

22:04.330 --> 22:05.580
<b>Why are you here?</b>

22:05.580 --> 22:07.920
<b>He was on the 7th layer
so I brought him with me.</b>

22:07.920 --> 22:10.130
<b>It was convenient because
he could handle the elevator thing</b>

22:10.130 --> 22:11.920
<b>to get out of the Underworld.</b>

22:11.920 --> 22:14.880
<b>And, we were able to meet up,
but what do we do now?</b>

22:14.880 --> 22:16.170
<b>What do we do? What, huh?</b>

22:16.170 --> 22:19.460
<b>You're pretending like we're still besties,
but I'm not over what you did yet.</b>

22:19.460 --> 22:21.250
<b>I'm truly so very sorry!</b>

22:21.500 --> 22:24.210
<b>Since Hanakawa was
entered in the selection battle,</b>

22:24.210 --> 22:26.830
<b>I think we should try to escape from
the battle area together.</b>

22:26.830 --> 22:29.170
<b>If we do that, Sion may come to kill us.</b>

22:29.170 --> 22:31.130
<b>So you can accomplish
what you're going for, right?</b>

22:31.380 --> 22:33.500
<b>I beg you, please refrain from doing that!</b>

22:33.500 --> 22:37.130
<b>There is no assurance that
my life will be spared!</b>

22:37.580 --> 22:38.830
<b>I'll avenge your death.</b>

22:38.830 --> 22:41.460
<b>So, I'm going to die no matter what?!</b>

22:47.790 --> 22:50.630
<b>Looks like it's finally settled.</b>

22:51.250 --> 22:53.290
<b>What kind of weapon can beat this girl?!</b>

22:53.290 --> 22:56.710
<b>What weapon? What weapon?
What weapon? What weapon?!</b>

22:56.710 --> 22:59.040
<b>WHAT WEAPON?!</b>

23:04.540 --> 23:05.630
<b>Hi!</b>

23:06.750 --> 23:09.210
<b>Oh, thank goodness! I'm glad you're safe!</b>

23:09.750 --> 23:12.250
<b>We made running away our top priority!</b>

23:12.250 --> 23:16.130
<b>We thought that if we could join up with
Takatou-kun, things would turn out okay.</b>

23:16.130 --> 23:17.830
<b>What are you going to do now?</b>

23:17.830 --> 23:20.040
<b>I'm going to lure Sion out
and get some inte-</b>

23:24.790 --> 23:26.210
<b>All of you, get behind me!</b>

23:26.210 --> 23:27.170
<b>Huh?</b>

23:37.130 --> 23:40.540
<b>"You Can Use Your Power Any Way You Want"</b>

23:37.130 --> 23:40.920
<b>"You Can Use Your Power Any Way You Want"</b>
